# =========================================================
# pi personnel (~/.pi/agent) — .gitignore
# Secrets, jetons et donnees vives ne doivent JAMAIS entrer
# dans le depot (meme prive) :
# =========================================================
# Secrets / jetons : a un fichier de substitution sur
# models.json.example (clé API MASQUEE)
auth.json
models-store.json
models.json
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.log
# Donnees de session pi (volatiles, regenerables)
sessions/
# Paquets pi installes (npm:) — reinstalles via pi install
npm/
# Fichiers en cache / temporaires
*.tmp

# --- git_it additions (the capture ships models.json REDACTED and one allow-listed
#     settings.json.bak under backup-wsl-powershell-hook/; negation keeps them tracked) ---
!pi-agent/models.json
!pi-agent/backup-wsl-powershell-hook/
!pi-agent/backup-wsl-powershell-hook/settings.json.bak
